[node name="OfficeStorytellingProps" type="Node3D"]

; The authored south-wall and west-wall fittings: the coat rack with a real
; hanging coat and hat, the night register frame, the service hatch with its
; worn counter sill, the message tray, the glass bell insulators and the strung
; wire run. Everything below it is the CSG blockout it replaced, kept invisible
; because the names and transforms are what the captures and checks measure.
[node name="AuthoredWallProps" type="MeshInstance3D" parent="."]
mesh = ExtResource("10_wall")

[node name="AuthoredWireRun" type="MeshInstance3D" parent="."]
mesh = ExtResource("11_wire")

; The authored regulator case: cornice, stiles, faceted brass bezel and an open
; pendulum trunk. Its origin is on the wall plane, local +X points into the room,
; and the dial lands at local x = 0.10 — the exact plane of StationClockFace
; below, so the dial, the twelve markers, the hands and the swinging bob are
; still the scene's own driven nodes and the case is only the case.
